  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "A climb below the leaders",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "masspeaks moved from 27th at the midnight baseline to 13th on the observed ARC-AGI-2 board, raising its public score from 34.86 to 42.50. That was the clearest verified climb among this edition’s tracked contenders. The team’s listed Kaggle account is masspeaks; the roster observation does not identify a person behind that handle."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Tufa keeps the field behind it",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-dries-smit-roster-0",
        "person-dries-smit-fact-1",
        "person-dries-smit-archive-0"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs remains first at 88.06. Its observed roster includes Dries Smit, whom ARC Prize credits as lead developer of the winning 2025 ARC-AGI-3 Preview agent. That earlier honor is a separate contest result; today’s ARC-AGI-2 lead is a public-board standing, with final awards still open."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The next group",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-jean-francois-puget-identity-0",
        "person-jean-francois-puget-roster-0",
        "person-jean-francois-puget-roster-1"
      ],
      "text": "rabbithole holds second at 80.56, Yi-Chia Chen third at 77.22 and nvbanana fourth at 77.08. Jean-François Puget’s verified cpmpml account appears on nvbanana here and on NVARC3 in the separate ARC-AGI-3 contest. _hans rounds out the first five at 69.03. These positions did not change against the recorded baseline."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Another score moves",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-keith-tyser-roster-0",
        "social-2108916273937858887"
      ],
      "text": "ARC Raiders recorded an improvement from 58.75 to 60 and remained eighth in the event history. Its baseline comparison is unavailable, so that event alone does not establish a net overnight gain. Tufa Labs said in a public reply that its ARC-AGI-2 effort began by accident and that it plans to explain more after the deadline; the team has not yet supplied a method in that post."
    }
